  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Digital Transformation and Sustainable Growth Program II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Transformacin Digital y Crecimiento Sostenible II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa es impulsar una mejora en la competitividad de Chile que promueva el crecimiento sostenible e inclusivo de su economa. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) acelerar la transformacin digital de los servicios pblicos y la conectividad digital; (ii) promover la transicin hacia modelos circulares de produccin; y (iii) promover la formalizacin del empleo mediante el apoyo a las micro y pequeas empresas (MYPE), el estmulo a la contratacin y la intermediacin laboral. La presente operacin de prstamo es la segunda de dos operaciones consecutivas de un solo desembolso cada una, vinculadas tcnicamente entre s pero financiadas en forma independiente, bajo la modalidad de Prstamo Programtico de Apoyo a Reformas de Poltica (PBP).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the program is to improve Chile&apos;s competitiveness that fosters sustainable and inclusive economic growth. The specific objectives are: (i) to accelerate the digital transformation of public services and digital connectivity; (ii) to promote the transition to circular production models; and (iii) to encourage the formalization of employment through support for micro and small enterprises (MSE), incentives for hiring, and labor intermediation. This loan operation is the second of two consecutive single-disbursement operations, technically linked to each other but independently financed, under the modality of a Programmatic Loan to Support Policy Reforms (PBP).</narrative>
  </description>
